[{"title":"过姑苏","author":"曹伯启","text":"城上云山罨画遮，城中民物压纷奢。\n金银璨错三千界，丹碧连绵几万家。\n麋鹿屡经成故事，燕莺依旧爱新花。\n清贫本是书生分，只想山林景物嘉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12997,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和王士美","author":"曹伯启","text":"十年里社记情亲，此日同登陌上尘。\n孔氏家声喧紫禁，王生诗笔健青春。\n楩楠定见为梁栋，鱼鸟那知在网纶。\n礼义扩充儒者事，菜羹疏食任吾真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12998,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵侯岩甫兼寄张景先","author":"曹伯启","text":"求官初拟报天伦，南北营营役此身。\n千里关山遮故友，十年尘土污行人。\n珠犀润屋心非素，诗礼传家道自新。\n邂逅还乡观二妙，文章如锦气如春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12999,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"丧马和平甫见赠","author":"曹伯启","text":"骅骝得自浙江西，远近重经总不迷。\n寒洗官河潮欲退，暖行村径草初齐。\n德驯喜藉还家力，病倒愁闻隔夜嘶。\n昨晚侍亲辞别墅，杖藜踏雪路高低。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13000,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送陈爱山教授归馀杭","author":"曹伯启","text":"曳曳文旌出暨阳，暑天形役兴悲凉。\n毛生有檄儒官淡，苏季无金世路长。\n数辈晚生传道德，十篇高谊见忠良。\n兰台指日能相近，鹗荐行看达尚方。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13001,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"丁亥清明东平寄二弟济州学正","author":"曹伯启","text":"忆昨分携春正寒，生涯到此又儒官。\n客中度日今非易，贫里攻书古亦难。\n接物谦和辞尚简，处身廉谨事容宽。\n我行更别双亲远，莫负因风数问安。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13002,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠刘彦卿","author":"曹伯启","text":"抗尘南北六经秋，拭目朝堂总俊游。\n闻道铨条待常品，便将心事拟清流。\n酒徒未识新丰客，舟子虚疑户牖侯。\n长路崎岖行又错，看人骑鹤上扬州。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13003,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠元伯士瞻二友","author":"曹伯启","text":"器识参差德未伦，白头心事尚如新。\n十年薄宦为迁客，四海亲情有二人。\n名族流芳各神俊，圣经充体自真纯。\n眼中轻薄何须数，它日南州愿卜邻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13004,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寿李野斋学士","author":"曹伯启","text":"紫禁衣冠旧绮园，玉堂仪彩更清温。\n自然官职名何重，无事威严道愈尊。\n万里春融谁可继，一宗元气谅斯存。\n瓣香献寿梅花底，愿比岷山活水源。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13005,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄菊圃宪副","author":"曹伯启","text":"十行丹诏发春雷，一脉阳和遍九垓。\n天下求安先肃政，浙东何幸遇全材。\n贪狼昼伏毛如立，老鹘宵征气已摧。\n山谷饥民厌烦酷，赐环消息不须来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13006,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵题兰溪洞源壁间","author":"曹伯启","text":"南北嚣尘日夜侵，好风吹到白云深。\n智仙久住誇山色，俗客初来恋竹阴。\n万事不如收脚坐，三年应负掉头吟。\n疲民不忍加鞭箠，谁识平生水石心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13007,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"己丑冬和杨塘徐改之 其一","author":"曹伯启","text":"大隐由来住远郊，箪瓢谁识是英曹。\n陶潜未得寻归计，杨子元能作解嘲。\n尽放阴阳催日驭，且收风月入霜毫。\n嗟嗟州县劳生客，千里关山马骨高。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13008,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"己丑冬和杨塘徐改之 其二","author":"曹伯启","text":"犬马无功答圣朝，催逋去郭应宣条。\n泥蟠曲径频巇险，寒迫孤衾倍寂寥。\n闾左凋伤徒轸念，马头麾叱莫扬骄。\n旱馀又值连朝雨，桂玉艰难有众谣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13009,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"初至金陵闻宪府诸公咏梁武镬莲花想像为赋","author":"曹伯启","text":"欲致芙蕖水面风，规规培植兴无穷。\n曾陪青草轩窗外，忽幻红衣鼎镬中。\n香色未饶春富贵，本根元抱玉玲珑。\n误承老柏垂清荫，拔地参天趣亦同。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13010,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵申仲礼寻梅","author":"曹伯启","text":"世间红紫俗难禁，盼到梅时忍倦寻。\n蜡蒂爱渠情不舍，琼苞想像意何深。\n问樵旋觅溪头路，随仆翻迷雪后林。\n自古诗人耽此癖，可怜寂寞岁寒心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13011,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和申仲礼","author":"曹伯启","text":"纷纷荣悴阅春花，惭愧山巅与水涯。\n不揣散材难补世，自投尘鞅却思家。\n黄紬覆首争槐蚁，藜杖支颐数屋鸦。\n岁莫情怀若为守，真同旅食住京华。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13012,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵赵仲权留别","author":"曹伯启","text":"江干惜别重依依，才学如君是俊奇。\n枥骥长鸣须北向，云鹏小却暂西之。\n萱堂趁捧椒盘酒，芹馆谁赓柳絮诗。\n莫恋倚晴风景好，不来簪盍慰相思。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13013,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送潘景梁佥事之福建","author":"曹伯启","text":"仕学推先得两优，绣衣分柄镇南州。\n礼曹回首非新进，宪府信眉是旧游。\n三楚冰霜随马策，七闽泉石入诗筹。\n计程似与梅花约，在在清香满道周。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13014,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵毛潜夫咏怀","author":"曹伯启","text":"早岁功名意未阑，便抛铅椠客长安。\n化工造育无偏陂，物理盈虚有剩悭。\n陌上红尘摧面目，梦中清露洒脾肝。\n于今不作求人计，芹馆依栖侍孔颜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13015,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王庭瑞经历之广东宪司","author":"曹伯启","text":"圣政优优布四方，绣衣宾幕姓名香。\n海隅守令难求备，天下浮誇喜变常。\n神志高閒烟瘴远，道途萦绕世缘长。\n庆门忠孝垂千古，又见闻孙叱驭郎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13016,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送程前村之京口","author":"曹伯启","text":"四圣能知本一心，却从流俗玩升沉。\n江湖胜观襟怀阔，天地穷源造化深。\n青眼相看常倒屣，碧云兴感欲投簪。\n人生离合非无数，送别江皋思不禁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13017,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题金御史所藏王彦章观马图","author":"曹伯启","text":"五季英豪王太师，百年仪像见横披。\n眼中汗血真龙种，身后声华古豹皮。\n伟节亭亭照今古，高风凛凛动华夷。\n兜鍪一奋成忠义，何似貂蝉老更痴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13018,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄郝知事二首 其一","author":"曹伯启","text":"诗礼渐摩气已清，冗官抛去世缘轻。\n未应落寞伤时态，想在淹留见俗情。\n士类会谈新德化，我曹犹佩旧章程。\n岁寒独有梅花树，凡草芳时岂见荣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13019,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄郝知事二首 其二","author":"曹伯启","text":"山光水色古犹今，人事联翩苦见侵。\n俗务日新公论减，簿书星急吏权深。\n名场久欲抽身去，诗伯相陪拥鼻吟。\n台阁搜贤到岩薮，故人能识向来心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13020,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"兰溪郊行","author":"曹伯启","text":"羸骖乘暇阅山乡，风景无边眼力强。\n千里稻云蒸大冶，一年梅澍积深塘。\n虎狼窜伏天刑近，鸡犬舒徐日驭长。\n微禄每惭无补报，欲将心事效平阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13021,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"泛舟次人韵","author":"曹伯启","text":"明月清风入素秋，摇摇官舫溯溪流。\n时违未要弹冯铗，兴浅还思上庾楼。\n匹马东来成底事，孤云西望不胜愁。\n沙鸥不解人间事，飞去飞来百自由。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13022,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送何好礼御史按部江浙","author":"曹伯启","text":"钟山横翠楚江空，寒气随君马首东。\n吴越英华诗有料，吏民情伪事无穷。\n雍容措置摅长策，慷慨施为合至公。\n三道伫看豺虎静，早回台阁复生风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13023,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"倚和吉甫提举见赠雨中述怀诗兼寄王觉轩山长","author":"曹伯启","text":"风雨潇潇夜未央，客床孤寂似禅床。\n庸材敢望日三接，佳士尚留天一方。\n万事到头都是梦，此心安处即吾乡。\n卜邻阳羡溪山好，远胜毗陵古战场。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13024,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"觉轩二子头角崭然盖乃翁生平积德设施所致因作数语颂之","author":"曹伯启","text":"西州文族姓名香，阶下三槐葆盖张。\n鹅眼不辞公府用，马蹄常为故人忙。\n言思切直心无碍，道合中庸气自刚。\n积庆臾沾山水秀，欲期阳羡作桐乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13025,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题白御史画马卷","author":"曹伯启","text":"玉面骐驎金络头，虎文龙翼气横秋。\n乘时欲骋追风足，制在奚官不自由。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13026,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题双骥并枥图","author":"曹伯启","text":"龙种权奇匀骨肉，筒耳铃眸籋云足。\n为君一饱死边庭，不作驽骀空厩粟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13027,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过白沟河","author":"曹伯启","text":"久听人间说白沟，两朝曾此界中州。\n而今六合无关禁，依旧潺湲碧水流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13028,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日省舅氏郭西独行因书所见十首 其一","author":"曹伯启","text":"田家桑梓碧幢幢，过客鞭声引吠尨。\n终岁耕耘竟何有，桑枢茅屋短篷窗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13029,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日省舅氏郭西独行因书所见十首 其二","author":"曹伯启","text":"霏微林雾惨秋容，撩乱山禽起晚舂。\n营马欲来粮已尽，二三癃老诉年凶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13030,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日省舅氏郭西独行因书所见十首 其三","author":"曹伯启","text":"翁媪携持陌上哀，问之行答涕沾怀。\n次男战死涪州界，欲问回军赎烬骸。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13031,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日省舅氏郭西独行因书所见十首 其四","author":"曹伯启","text":"五霸兵争总祸机，三王仁治但垂衣。\n老农不解兴亡事，唯说今年豆角稀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13032,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日省舅氏郭西独行因书所见十首 其五","author":"曹伯启","text":"浩浩阴风酿宿霾，道边佛刹记曾来。\n荞花不识秋光老，犹向桑阴密处开。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13033,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日省舅氏郭西独行因书所见十首 其六","author":"曹伯启","text":"遥空无碍日凄凄，过雨平田尚有泥。\n极目断鸿明灭处，淡烟衰草一时低。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13034,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日省舅氏郭西独行因书所见十首 其七","author":"曹伯启","text":"松杉秋到影逾浓，梨杜霜前叶半红。\n荒径忽迷寻不得，罄躬还问牧牛童。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13035,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日省舅氏郭西独行因书所见十首 其八","author":"曹伯启","text":"豪家此日醉金樽，驴背愁诗睡正昏。\n野雉一声惊梦散，苍烟起处是前村。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13036,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日省舅氏郭西独行因书所见十首 其九","author":"曹伯启","text":"十年辛苦益清贫，自叹儒冠果误身。\n尽说世间骐骥少，年来谁是九方歅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13037,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日省舅氏郭西独行因书所见十首 其十","author":"曹伯启","text":"阘茸营营禄有馀，孔方羞涩只閒居。\n小胥挥叱乡人恐，惭愧芸窗苦读书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13038,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题市桥游乐图二首 其一","author":"曹伯启","text":"小桥流水湛清波，无限游人载酒过。\n怪得年来粮饷少，田夫不及一分多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13039,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题市桥游乐图二首 其二","author":"曹伯启","text":"暖烟轻染柳条新，和气氤氲簇画轮。\n衮衮春风游冶客，岂知脚底有饥人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13040,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"元夕会饮命教堂各赋一绝时招讨张公在座","author":"曹伯启","text":"煌煌灯火万家新，和气薰涵太古春。\n有酒不妨连夜饮，金吾同是座中宾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13041,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜宿清河","author":"曹伯启","text":"云屋人家星散居，郭西烟火夜停车。\n平生习气今犹在，拄杖敲门看读书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13042,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"保定","author":"曹伯启","text":"郁郁孤城百雉高，当年粉堞尽蓬蒿。\n清波忽见行人影，惭愧红尘染鬓毛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13043,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"涿州观寺","author":"曹伯启","text":"佛刹新脩古道傍，插天金碧晃朝阳。\n人来为问灵光殿，霖雨今年草更长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13044,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠画师佟明之","author":"曹伯启","text":"易写无盐陋子都，难形小白下夷吾。\n英雄事业传千古，不假丹青作画图。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13045,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题何舜卿鱼水清白图","author":"曹伯启","text":"桥梓相传清白在，君臣鱼水千年会。\n谁知一握小横披，开国承家理无外。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13046,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄刘彦卿同舍二首 其一","author":"曹伯启","text":"济济声华久见称，青云豪气小陈登。\n东州邂逅人非旧，始信千年谷变陵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13047,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄刘彦卿同舍二首 其二","author":"曹伯启","text":"君立吴蒙伯仲间，我惭失学似君难。\n何时握手文山去，得使儿曹刮目看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13048,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题叶宾月图二首 其一","author":"曹伯启","text":"广文胸次瑩无尘，明月知音自主宾。\n更约飞廉作三益，秖防云物忌情亲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13049,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题叶宾月图二首 其二","author":"曹伯启","text":"当歌对酒永相依，妙契灵光烛万微。\n多少长安名利眼，只知三五看扬辉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13050,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹枝画眉图","author":"曹伯启","text":"飘飘独占碧琅玕，湛湛秋波月一弯。\n酷爱清声能洗耳，恍然羸马度春山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13051,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过滹沱河","author":"曹伯启","text":"当年天意欲兴刘，倏忽冰凝水不流。\n此日王郎如解事，鞬櫜弓矢便宜休。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13052,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"蠡州蟾河","author":"曹伯启","text":"一溪流水碧溶溶，闻说蟾蜍在此中。\n我亦去为攀桂客，相逢多在广寒宫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13053,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用溪陂塘松庵壁间韵","author":"曹伯启","text":"松庵寂寂老僧閒，万壑千岩指顾间。\n笑杀孔门忧世客，西风尘土变朱颜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13054,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次范药房韵题姜仲泽岩隐二首 其一","author":"曹伯启","text":"纷纷尘土化朱颜，有客知几去不还。\n大隐何妨在城市，小楼终日对云鬟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13055,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次范药房韵题姜仲泽岩隐二首 其二","author":"曹伯启","text":"夷夏同声咏息肩，车书万里旧山川。\n承明台阁诸贤在，甘分林丘养暮年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13056,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"定兴喜见太行山","author":"曹伯启","text":"小年闻说此山名，梦里西游隐见形。\n今日得观真面目，却教低首愧山灵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13057,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"曹伯启","text":"圣道如天不可升，文章徒写众人情。\n穷年矻矻今迟暮，两字虚中学未成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13058,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"对雪寄范平甫二首 其一","author":"曹伯启","text":"拂曙阴风舞六花，满城和气醉流霞。\n腊前已见三登瑞，宿麦连云有几家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13059,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"对雪寄范平甫二首 其二","author":"曹伯启","text":"梅边读易看飞花，时复拈杯脸晕霞。\n一枕江南春梦破，两椽茅屋是吾家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13060,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"海外贡花驴过 其一","author":"曹伯启","text":"当年老鹤快乘轩，犹逊花驴食万钱。\n昨夜灯前成独笑，痴儿方诵旅獒篇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13061,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"海外贡花驴过 其二","author":"曹伯启","text":"航海梯山事可疑，眼前今日看瑰奇。\n布韦且莫怀孤愤，秋菊春兰自一时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13062,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"海外贡花驴过 其三","author":"曹伯启","text":"天地精英及海隅，兽毛文彩号花驴。\n同来使者如乌鬼，还责中原礼法疏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13063,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"海外贡花驴过 其四","author":"曹伯启","text":"行台飞檄敬来王，多少饥膏委路傍。\n忽见狂人鞭老骥，眼眵成滴背成疮。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13064,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次朱路教","author":"曹伯启","text":"十年萍梗走京尘，惭负萱堂鹤发亲。\n重读新诗见真趣，西风黄叶更愁人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13065,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"卢沟桥","author":"曹伯启","text":"舆马连年东复西，巨鳌双胁夹青猊。\n荷旃食肉无非命，憔悴相如不敢题。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13066,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"安平客舍","author":"曹伯启","text":"荒城四面尽陂陀，人傍西山语渐讹。\n一夜饭牛棚下宿，愁闻闾里笑声多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13067,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a85789